+	<!-- custom: Width of the FeatureGenerator's Jungle fractal acceptance band; higher values make more eligible plots receive Jungle. Both BTS and AdvCiv use 80; latitude, Climate, terrain eligibility, and map-script overrides still apply. (GPT-5.6-Sol) -->
