 <!-- -->
-<!-- custom: comments moved to as of now to (adjust to your mod path) C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Sid Meier's Civilization IV Beyond the Sword\Beyond the Sword\Mods\AdvCiv-SAS\Long_Comments\ for concision and as they were too lengthy. Values not updated there, see this XML file here for updated values -->
